<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Saudi's Arab National Bank H1 97 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi's Arab National Bank H1 97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  251.49   vs	230.11</p>
<p> Operating income	1,127.09   vs    1,080.18</p>
<p> Operating expenses	888.42   vs	876.71</p>
<p> Liabilities	     31,856.32  vs   29,669.90</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  3,028.55   vs    2,854.61</p>
<p> Assets		   34,884.87   vs   32,524.51</p>
<p>Full Name: Arab National Bank.</p>
<p>Note - Based in Saudi Arabia, Arab National Bank is 40 percent owned by the Amman-based Arab Bank Ltd. The rest is held by Saudi investors. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
